<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued a total of seven million American-style call and put warrants, in 14 equal tranches on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The warrants are all exercisable from January 27, 1997 until October 22, 1997.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
